{"id": "163885e3-bcb8-4f1a-84f1-8ee58ed699b2", "slug": "crystal-arrays-digital-architecture", "title": "Crystal Arrays | Digital Architecture", "description": "Crystal Arrays CTA Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Crystal Arrays | Digital Architecture\"\ndescription: \"Crystal Arrays CTA Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Cinzel\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Manrope\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Crystal Arrays | Digital Architecture\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 136; favorites: 13; remixes: 6.\nTags: cta, animated, webgl, threejs, navigation, links, flow, action.\n## Overview\nCrystal Arrays CTA Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nConstructing Geometry ARCHITECTURA Gallery Manifesto Access Menu CRYSTAL ARRAYS Defining the geometry of the next generation of digital luxury and architectural precision. Enter Vault Coord: 34.0522° N, 118.2437° W Sect…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: CRYSTAL ARRAYS.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FFFFFF, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Cinzel for display moments and Manrope for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Crystal Arrays | Digital Architecture</title>\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;500;600&family=Manrope:wght@200;300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script type=\"importmap\">\n      {\n        \"imports\": {\n          \"three\": \"https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js\",\n          \"three/addons/\": \"https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/examples/jsm/\"\n        }\n      }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative h-screen w-full overflow-hidden bg-neutral-900 text-white selection:bg-white selection:text-black\" style=\"font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Loading Overlay -->\n    <div id=\"loader\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-neutral-900\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-6\">\n        <div class=\"relative h-[1px] w-24 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-800\">\n          <div id=\"loader-bar\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-1/3 bg-white\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-neutral-400\" style=\"font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;\">Constructing Geometry</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 outline-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Scrim Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-neutral-900/90 via-neutral-900/20 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n    <!-- UI Layer -->\n    <div class=\"pointer-events-none relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-between px-6 py-8 md:px-12 md:py-10\">\n\n      <!-- Header -->\n      <header class=\"nav-item pointer-events-auto flex w-full items-center justify-between opacity-0\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:smart-home-angle-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n          <span class=\"text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;\">ARCHITECTURA</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <nav class=\"hidden gap-8 md:flex\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\">Gallery</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\">Manifesto</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\">Access</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <button class=\"group flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-300 transition-colors group-hover:text-white\">Menu</span>\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-neutral-300 transition-colors group-hover:text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n        </button>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- Main Content -->\n      <main class=\"hero-content flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center text-center opacity-0\">\n\n        <div class=\"mb-8 h-[1px] w-12 bg-white/30\"></div>\n\n        <h1 class=\"mb-6 mix-blend-overlay text-5xl font-light leading-none tracking-tight text-white md:text-7xl lg:text-9xl\" style=\"font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;\">\n          CRYSTAL<br>\n          <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-neutral-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">ARRAYS</span>\n        </h1>\n\n        <p class=\"mb-12 max-w-md text-xs font-extralight leading-relaxed tracking-wide text-neutral-300 md:max-w-xl md:text-sm\">\n          Defining the geometry of the next generation of digital luxury and architectural precision.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"pointer-events-auto group relative overflow-hidden\">\n          <button class=\"relative z-10 border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-10 py-4 text-xs font-normal uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/60 hover:bg-white/10 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\">\n            Enter Vault\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 translate-y-full bg-gradient-to-t from-white/10 to-transparent transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-y-0\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </main>\n\n      <!-- Footer -->\n      <footer class=\"nav-item pointer-events-auto flex w-full items-end justify-between text-neutral-500 opacity-0\">\n        <div class=\"hidden text-xs uppercase tracking-widest md:block\">\n          <p>Coord: 34.0522° N, 118.2437° W</p>\n          <p>Sector: 7G-Alpha</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <button class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-neutral-800 transition-colors hover:border-white/40\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n          <span class=\"hidden text-xs uppercase tracking-widest sm:block\">Explore Parallax</span>\n        </div>\n      </footer>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Logic -->\n    <script type=\"module\">\n      import * as THREE from 'three';\n      import { RGBELoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/RGBELoader.js';\n      import { EffectComposer } from 'three/addons/postprocessing/EffectComposer.js';\n      import { RenderPass } from 'three/addons/postprocessing/RenderPass.js';\n      import { UnrealBloomPass } from 'three/addons/postprocessing/UnrealBloomPass.js';\n      import { OutputPass } from 'three/addons/postprocessing/OutputPass.js';\n\n      // GSAP Loader Animation\n      gsap.to(\"#loader-bar\", {\n        x: \"200%\",\n        duration: 1.2,\n        ease: \"power1.inOut\",\n        yoyo: true,\n        repeat: -1\n      });\n\n      // Config\n      const CONFIG = {\n        bg: 0x171717,\n        monolithCount: 7,\n        glassColor: 0xffffff,\n        bloomStrength: 0.35,\n        bloomRadius: 0.85,\n        bloomThreshold: 0.7\n      };\n\n      // Scene\n      const canvas = document.querySelector('#webgl-canvas');\n      const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n      scene.background = new THREE.Color(CONFIG.bg);\n      scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(CONFIG.bg, 0.035);\n\n      const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\n      camera.position.set(0, 1, 12);\n\n      const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({\n        canvas: canvas,\n        antialias: true,\n        powerPreference: \"high-performance\",\n        stencil: false,\n        depth: true\n      });\n      renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n      renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n      renderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\n      renderer.toneMappingExposure = 1.2;\n\n      // Environment\n      const rgbeLoader = new RGBELoader();\n      rgbeLoader.load('https://dl.polyhaven.org/file/ph-assets/HDRIs/hdr/1k/studio_small_09_1k.hdr', function(texture) {\n        texture.mapping = THREE.EquirectangularReflectionMapping;\n        scene.environment = texture;\n      });\n\n      const dirLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 2);\n      dirLight.position.set(5, 10, 7);\n      scene.add(dirLight);\n\n      const backLight = new THREE.SpotLight(0xaaddff, 5);\n      backLight.position.set(-5, 5, -5);\n      backLight.lookAt(0,0,0);\n      scene.add(backLight);\n\n      // Objects\n      const monoliths = [];\n      const geometry = new THREE.BoxGeometry(1.2, 5.5, 0.4);\n\n      const material = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\n        color: CONFIG.glassColor,\n        metalness: 0.1,\n        roughness: 0.05,\n        transmission: 1.0,\n        thickness: 1.5,\n        ior: 1.55,\n        side: THREE.DoubleSide,\n        clearcoat: 1.0,\n        clearcoatRoughness: 0.1,\n        attenuationTint: 0xffffff,\n        attenuationDistance: 0.5\n      });\n\n      for (let i = 0; i < CONFIG.monolithCount; i++) {\n        const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n        const offset = (i - CONFIG.monolithCount / 2) * 1.5;\n        const zOffset = Math.sin(i * 0.8) * 2;\n\n        mesh.position.set(offset, -10, zOffset);\n        mesh.rotation.y = Math.random() * Math.PI;\n        mesh.scale.set(1, 0.8 + Math.random() * 0.4, 1);\n\n        mesh.userData = {\n          rotationSpeed: 0.002 + Math.random() * 0.002,\n          originalY: -0.5 + Math.random() * 0.5\n        };\n\n        scene.add(mesh);\n        monoliths.push(mesh);\n      }\n\n      // Post Processing\n      const composer = new EffectComposer(renderer);\n      composer.addPass(new RenderPass(scene, camera));\n      composer.addPass(new UnrealBloomPass(\n        new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight),\n        CONFIG.bloomStrength,\n        CONFIG.bloomRadius,\n        CONFIG.bloomThreshold\n      ));\n      composer.addPass(new OutputPass());\n\n      // Interaction\n      const mouse = new THREE.Vector2();\n      const targetCamera = new THREE.Vector3(0, 1, 12);\n\n      window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n        mouse.x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth) * 2 - 1;\n        mouse.y = -(e.clientY / window.innerHeight) * 2 + 1;\n      });\n\n      window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n        camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n        camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        composer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n      });\n\n      // Loop\n      const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n      function animate() {\n        requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        const time = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n        monoliths.forEach((mesh, i) => {\n          mesh.rotation.y += mesh.userData.rotationSpeed;\n          mesh.position.y += Math.sin(time * 0.5 + i) * 0.002;\n        });\n\n        targetCamera.x = mouse.x * 2;\n        targetCamera.y = 1 + (mouse.y * 0.5);\n\n        camera.position.lerp(targetCamera, 0.03);\n        camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n        composer.render();\n      }\n\n      // Sequence\n      window.onload = () => {\n        animate();\n\n        const tl = gsap.timeline();\n\n        tl.to(\"#loader\", {\n          opacity: 0,\n          duration: 0.8,\n          onComplete: () => { document.getElementById(\"loader\").style.display = 'none'; }\n        })\n        .to(monoliths.map(m => m.position), {\n          y: (i) => monoliths[i].userData.originalY,\n          duration: 2.5,\n          stagger: { amount: 1, from: \"center\" },\n          ease: \"power3.out\"\n        }, \"-=0.2\")\n        .to(\".nav-item\", {\n          opacity: 1,\n          duration: 1,\n          stagger: 0.1\n        }, \"-=1.5\")\n        .to(\".hero-content\", {\n          opacity: 1,\n          y: 0,\n          duration: 1.2,\n          ease: \"power2.out\"\n        }, \"-=1.0\");\n      };\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "crystal-arrays-digital-architecture.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/crystal-arrays-digital-architecture.jpg", "source_name": "crystal-arrays-digital-architecture-DESIGN.md", "views": 227, "forks": 10, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T13:14:27.564186+00:00"}